# Nexus of Becoming: "At the beginning of combat on your turn, draw a card. Then you may exile an artifact or creature card from your
# hand. If you do, create a token that's a copy of the exiled card, except it's a 3/3 Golem artifact creature in addition to its
# other types." Turn 1 Bot1 casts it with two Black Lotuses. At its combat it draws (Plains), may exile only an artifact or
# creature card (the Lightning Bolt and the Plains are refused) and exiles Savannah Lions: the token is a Savannah Lions copy, white,
# a Cat Golem artifact creature, 3/3 instead of 2/1 (CR 707.2, 707.9b). Turn 3 Bot1 exiles Mox Pearl, a non-creature artifact, and
# the token is an artifact creature Mox 3/3 that still taps for {W} (the copy keeps its abilities). Bot2's turn 2 combat draws nothing.

